        "TileImage": "$($repository 0e4c615e-e05d-492f-9e8a-08233aae000a).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. The ICA has recently received a series of five connected contracts, with the first being two of our very own employees. The two twin brothers serve as sentries for the final test of our training program, but as it turns out, they are in fact selling our secrets to our biggest competitor: Netanyahu. He has been learning the ways of our business in order to most effectively kill as many people he can with his bare hands. Needless to say, we must stop this, 47. Good luck.",
